      <Docs>
        <param name="renderFlags">the render flag, or the logical OR of multiple render flags. Value is either 0 or a combination of the following: RenderParams.FLAG_RENDER_TEXT_ANNOTATIONS; RenderParams.FLAG_RENDER_HIGHLIGHT_ANNOTATIONS; RenderParams.FLAG_RENDER_STAMP_ANNOTATIONS; RenderParams.FLAG_RENDER_FREETEXT_ANNOTATIONS</param>
        <param name="mask">Value is either 0 or a combination of the following: RenderParams.FLAG_RENDER_TEXT_ANNOTATIONS; RenderParams.FLAG_RENDER_HIGHLIGHT_ANNOTATIONS; RenderParams.FLAG_RENDER_STAMP_ANNOTATIONS; RenderParams.FLAG_RENDER_FREETEXT_ANNOTATIONS</param>
        <summary>Sets the state of the render flag specified by the mask.</summary>
        <returns>To be added.</returns>
        <remarks>
          <para>Sets the state of the render flag specified by the mask. To change all render flags at once, see setRenderFlags(int).</para>
          <para>When a render flag is enabled, it will be displayed on the updated Bitmap of the renderer.</para>
          <para>Multiple indicator types may be enabled or disabled by passing the logical OR of the desired flags. If multiple flags are specified, they will all be set to the same enabled state.</para>
          <para>For example, to enable the render text annotations flag: setRenderFlags(FLAG_RENDER_TEXT_ANNOTATIONS, FLAG_RENDER_TEXT_ANNOTATIONS)</para>
          <para>To disable the render text annotations flag: setRenderFlags(0, FLAG_RENDER_TEXT_ANNOTATIONS)</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/pdf/RenderParams.Builder#setRenderFlags(int,%20int)" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.graphics.pdf.RenderParams.Builder.setRenderFlags</code>.</a></format></para>
